[{"id":3498038803,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Qf9YT","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I wonder about the performance implications, especially making `get_top_selected_node_list()` return a new list.\n\nAnd speaking of `top_selected_node_list`, does it have to still be a list? It could be LocalVector, since it's no longer returned directly. Although the way this list is used, I wonder if it needs to be changed at all. You are copying ObjectIDs into it, but then it's only ever returned and not used in any other way. But I guess making it still use pointers can create some unsafe edge case.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111837#pullrequestreview-3498038803","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111837","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111837#pullrequestreview-3498038803"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111837"}},"submitted_at":"2025-11-24T13:05:47Z","commit_id":null},{"